Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:43.64,sign_Arial,text (header),0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H4D4D4D&\shad0\bord4\fad(268,1)}Regarding Loss Cut Rules\N\N {\c&H6A6A6A&\3c&HC5C1C4&\shad0\q2\fs8}Loss cut rules are a system by which your active positions are automatically force-liquidated (cutting losses),\N in order to limit losses on leveraged trades caused by market fluctuations.\N\NIn the event your margin level falls below a base amount set by our firm, loss cut rules will activate. Upon activation, a process will occur in the following sequence.\N\N 1. We cancel all your unexecuted orders.\N 2. If your margin level does not recover as a result of step 1, we force-liquidate (cut losses on) all of your currently held positions.
